# Scene 6: catch a real bug. Two tracks recorded together and directed: Order.cs in a code screen, and a real shell in
# a git worktree of this repository (reels/setup.sh makes and resets it). The shell plants a one-line bug and runs the
# Quickstart tests; the code screen waits for each of its steps and morphs into the same edit as it lands. Nothing here
# is staged: the failures are whatever the tests print.
Import //reels/entities.reelpreset

Screen code as code
  Set Viewport 1100x760
  Set FontSize 18
  Set WaitTimeout 3m
  Code //examples/Nullean.Entities.Quickstart/Order.cs at "public Order Cancel()"
  Focus lines 16-25
  Wait for planted
  Morph@ease-in-out,1400ms //reels/code/Order.cancel-bug.cs at "public Order Cancel()"
  Focus lines 16-24
  Mark "public Order Cancel() => this with" 1
  Callout "public Order Cancel() => this with" "the status check, simplified away"
  Wait for caught
  Callout off
  Mark off
  Wait for reverting
  Morph@ease-in-out,1400ms //examples/Nullean.Entities.Quickstart/Order.cs at "public Order Cancel()" as reverted
  Focus lines 16-25
  Wait for green

Screen terminal as term
  Set Theme //reels/entities.ghostty
  Set WorkingDirectory ~/code/wt/entities/reel-live
  Set Title "entities — zsh"
  Set Columns 150
  Set Rows 56
  Set FontSize 13
  Set WaitTimeout 3m
  Type@0ms "export DOTNET_NOLOGO=1 DOTNET_CLI_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT=1 TESTINGPLATFORM_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT=1; git checkout -- .; clear"
  Key return
  Wait exit as ready
  Wait for hello to end
  Type "cp .artifacts/planted/Order.cs examples/Nullean.Entities.Quickstart/Order.cs"
  Key return as planted
  Wait exit
  Wait for cleanup to end
  Type "dotnet run --project tests/Nullean.Entities.Quickstart.Tests -f net10.0 -- --treenode-filter \"/*/*/QuickstartTests/*\""
  Key return as running
  Wait /Test run summary/
  Wait exit
  # The terminal is tall (the whole report fits): zoomed onto its top half, both failures and their seeds.
  Zoom@smooth,900ms @420,400 1.5x
  Mark "Idempotency failed" 1
  Mark "legal-moves does not allow" 2
  Callout "Twice gave" "Version 2: cancelled twice"
  Sleep 200ms as caught
  Wait for seed
  Callout off
  Callout ".Seed(" "replays exactly this case"
  Wait for replays to end
  Callout off
  Mark off
  Zoom@smooth,700ms off
  Type "git checkout -- . && clear"
  Key return as reverting
  Wait exit
  Key up 2
  Key return
  Wait /Test run summary/
  Wait exit
  Mark "Passed!" 1
  Sleep 2s as green

Output //.artifacts/reel/scenes/06-live.mp4
Set WaitTimeout 3m
Set Layout social ? code / term : code | term

# Off camera: the shell starts clean (the worktree reset, the screen cleared). Hide is the director's: it cuts every track.
Hide
Wait for ready to end
Show

Say "Now a real bug. The order on the left, a real shell on the right." as hello
Say@skeptic "Go on then. Break it."
Wait for planted
Say "A harmless-looking cleanup: Cancel no longer checks the status first." as cleanup
Spotlight term
Wait for running
Say "And now the tests nobody wrote. One per axis the rules declare."
# Speed is the director's: inside a track it would shorten that track alone, and the tracks would drift apart.
Speed 4x
Wait for caught
Speed off
Fullscreen@smooth,800ms term
Say "Two of five fail. Idempotency: cancel twice, and the version goes up twice."
Say "And the invariant: a shipped order can now be cancelled. The transitions never allowed that move."
Pip@smooth,1s code over term top-right
Say@skeptic "From one line. I didn't write a test for either of those." as seed
Say "Each one shrunk to the smallest case, with a seed that replays it while you fix it." as replays
Wait for reverted
Say "Put the check back,"
Speed 4x
Wait for green
Speed off
Layout@smooth,800ms social ? code / term : code | term
Spotlight off
Say "and all five pass."
Sleep 1s
